              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalolo suku kusihlwa, ngolokuqala lweviki, iminyango ivaliwe lapho ababebuthene khona abafundi ngokwesaba abaJuda, uJesu wafika wema phakathi kwabo, wathi kubo: “Ukuthula makube kinina.",
          "type": "text",
